---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DataHeader from "../../components/data/DataHeader.astro";
import metadata from "../../data/metadata.json";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Peterborough By The Numbers | AJ Shearer"
  description="Explore Peterborough municipal budgets, spending trends and recorded Council votes with source-linked public data."
  canonical="https://vote.ajshearer.com/data"
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-[#f8f1f3] text-[#3a1a22]">
    <DataHeader />

    <section class="overflow-hidden bg-[#651024] text-white">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#f0cbd5]">Data · Context · Accountability</div>
          <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-tight md:text-7xl">Don't take my word for it.</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-8 text-white/85">Look at the data. Explore where City money goes, how the numbers change over time, and how Council made significant decisions behind them through a growing verified voting archive.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/data/budget" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 font-bold text-[#651024]">Explore the budget</a>
            <a href="/data/votes" class="rounded-full border border-white/35 px-5 py-3 font-bold text-white">Council vote explorer</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur md:p-8">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#f0cbd5]">The standard</div>
          <div class="mt-5 space-y-5">
            <div><div class="text-2xl font-black">Source it.</div><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">Public claims should trace back to an official City document, report or minute.</p></div>
            <div><div class="text-2xl font-black">Label it.</div><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">Draft, recommended, adopted and actual figures are different things. The dashboard keeps them different.</p></div>
            <div><div class="text-2xl font-black">Separate fact from analysis.</div><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">The data layer should be useful even to someone who disagrees with my political conclusions.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a href="/data/budget" class="group rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#eadde1] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg md:p-9">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#651024]">01 · Budget</div>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">Where does the money go?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#7a6167]">Compare operating totals and normalized service trends without hiding reorganizations, recategorizations or shortened comparison windows.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 font-bold text-[#651024]">Open budget explorer →</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/data/votes" class="group rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#eadde1] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg md:p-9">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#651024]">02 · Council votes</div>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">How did Council vote?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#7a6167]">Search significant motions by topic, financial impact and councillor, with a source link back to the official record.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 font-bold text-[#651024]">Open vote explorer →</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/data/tax-drivers" class="group rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#eadde1] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg md:p-9">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#651024]">03 · Tax drivers</div>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">What actually drove the increase?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#7a6167]">See the City's final 2026 levy-change factors, with Legacy Fund history showing the difference between recurring investment-income policy and one-time tax-rate support used in both 2024 and 2026.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 font-bold text-[#651024]">Open tax-driver analysis →</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/data/outcomes" class="group rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#eadde1] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg md:p-9">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#651024]">04 · Outcomes</div>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">What are we getting for it?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#7a6167]">Track whether housing, transit, public safety and housing-system indicators are improving or worsening—and where the available reporting is still too thin to say.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 font-bold text-[#651024]">Open outcomes & KPIs →</div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <section class="mt-12 rounded-3xl border border-[#e7d6db] bg-[#fffafb] p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(18rem,34rem)] lg:items-start">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#651024]">Current build status</div>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Foundation dataset</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f8f1f3] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold leading-6 text-[#651024] lg:text-right">
            <span class="font-black">Scope:</span> {metadata.scope}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eadde1] bg-white p-5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">Budget</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-[#3a1a22]">2022–2026 backbone</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">{metadata.budgetSeriesCount} normalized service and component series, with reorganizations and shortened comparison windows called out rather than hidden.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eadde1] bg-white p-5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">Council votes</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-[#3a1a22]">{metadata.verifiedMotionCount} verified motions</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">Official recorded votes, financial context where known, plus a dedicated Strong Mayor Powers topic and decision timeline.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#eadde1] bg-white p-5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">Outcomes</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-[#3a1a22]">Fresh data first</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">2025 actuals lead where available. Older RGI, police-output and infrastructure-condition measures are deliberately demoted to historical context.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <details class="group mt-5 border-t border-[#eadde1] pt-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-[#651024] marker:hidden">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              Technical build details
              <span class="transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7a6167] lg:grid-cols-3">
            <p>{metadata.budgetDataStatus}.</p>
            <p>{metadata.voteDataStatus}.</p>
            <p>{metadata.outcomeDataStatus}.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
